#: scenario4:scenario4_888D00E4_5DDF_4A0F_AC21_3C76072CE6C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12d7b8e6509ede17fcd0889aff7152ed51215de61448e62958fc9ff33136c5a8
