msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_888D00E4_5DDF_4A0F_AC21_3C76072CE6C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Hehehe..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫呵呵呵……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65a3be6f878765e5365251aa95e6734253d467104c5162c73f548c4b4bdab457
#. default-sha256: 9ae8c412b22a4906e158c6938092226af469b9ce382849839697d719e1bbaa0a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_30E5E1BB_B7F2_4FAF_BA5D_69954D3BD547"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You know now who you are, do you not?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You remember everything now, do you "
"not?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫您……⟪k:3⟫究竟是谁，⟪k:4⟫不是已经很清楚了吗？⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫所有的一切……⟪k:7⟫不是全都回忆"
"起来了吗？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 540498ff9dd30072c7d3edc99ec1dc06c3e60ac4646909b30a533f591fdee16c
#. default-sha256: 9c3aa55a89231c0ff065e3545a3f0c0f33a7636210beae1a816fcad6e47d5827
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B194619B_C01B_4ED1_A384_43CC74CC0CBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were present in every single era.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The reason for which is as I described in the "
"previous tale:"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫老爷您，⟪k:1⟫其实，⟪k:2⟫在每一段历史中都曾「出现」过。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫其理由，⟪k:5⟫现在就由下仆我，"
"⟪k:6⟫来告诉您吧……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14773a6de2d3e2d167a0d68eac6d916ac7919cf3dc929e7ea956d6d1b5207f25
#. default-sha256: 972a4c2f7d63463e9df90f196b6b7d19c1bce64f3f8424df459a9b268dbf35b3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_74CD1C8A_A4D5_41B2_9FA0_8BACE6033A72"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫because you yearned to be reunited with someone.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But that person never showed up—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫in any era."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫老爷您，⟪k:1⟫本有一位必须要见到的人。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫但是无论哪个年代，⟪k:4⟫那个人都不在。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0010d537dc3d83657b85a892038a02a752868d1c678c8d98ec76c1abb1bfd5c0
#. default-sha256: 4a4ab4e97bcb8d4c75f1a7aac5a4e639cf470d9cef0d2adef373f3f0c2deb185
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AF0F7A7E_BAC4_4A40_9E07_65C1528B46FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And poor, sweet you, having no memory of any of that..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫更让人同情的是，⟪k:2⟫您连那份记忆都失去了……⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫虽说您还是原来的您……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dcb9680520a628dd1aef6ba741257298e7492f661eb0bc222f5955fc8cb7c461
#. default-sha256: 64c702613e21d42413d03c2eadce925fc30aacb57f20c775a7eb6feb5ae250d1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E428239F_CEA7_4A3E_8AC2_7DB486476010"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫lived those lives with other men."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但您的人生轨迹，⟪k:1⟫却和其他男性相汇合了。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32eecce37c799369f4d19cd47718148fe425d8de245a7f28b41247eba6596b99
#. default-sha256: 7abd9bf3acd2e083eeb88ca137ebca82344b00302bc9a18a49efc128691e40d2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D4DC32D_2721_4440_ACF6_FDC1CD804679"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Is it any surprise misfortune befell those eras, then?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫正是因为如此才会引起了诸多的不幸吧……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46f5e3fc574a0c4fda89b17d878abe2c639e8bfcddd52f8b40045515f2b99277
#. default-sha256: 1c6063dfd60b7edc3f94d097a22bd9ab52fbcb384d589c9cacd1de51baaec8c2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7184B801_A9A2_4A5A_825E_52C1CB605614"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door swung closed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫眼前的门扉已经合上。⟪k:1⟫但是——"

#: scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bca4a1c83a6510dc37174330f0fe6bc8b5d4b3303dd32b78a9d47858de17c3b
#. default-sha256: 0468cb4dca23e9eecd77ff93460d1238eaa42fd9b4b1baec23c0504146d6f969
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_93E5634F_9071_481C_80D5_5D5B3D1A7903"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But rather than outside, ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ and the Maid were inside the dull, "
"monochrome room at the top of the observation tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「⟪k:1⟫你⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫死者⟪k:4⟫」与女仆，⟪k:5⟫却依旧留在了门内侧的这个世界。⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫眼前是已褪"
"下所有色彩的，⟪k:8⟫瞭望塔内的光景。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfe56941afbffe8d1fb266f7a14bdbcd443441e81ebb53e92c79f04c2447d057
#. default-sha256: 100f8b4e4e5bc4ccc15a56582a0d1ea5231b4a3830d356288aa07b592780efc3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E4A94C21_3189_4168_A05B_E2C567BCADA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The awe-inspiring ray of light shone not through the lone window high upon the stone wall."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫原本窗口注入的，⟪k:1⟫那道圣洁的光，⟪k:2⟫此刻也已不见踪影。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6291999e00b2c3d744164c3cde7f7fc8beaf79457f01663bedc93152ee3e4422
#. default-sha256: 7364102c5a779e194241367f534ec8df3e13c51390dfff28910b573be5885d9e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9AD4ACE6_C165_4387_AB8B_965A367809DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Wrapped in a curious, impenetrable darkness, ⟪k:1⟫You both⟪k:2⟫they⟪k:3⟫ stood alone in the "
"room."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫留在这不可思议的黑暗之中的——⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫只有⟪k:3⟫「⟪k:4⟫你⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫死者⟪k:7⟫」和女仆而已。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ac3d23a804e5bdf6f12238d6cdbe926de7c5a3d249fef6a4c41dd5fa7218bdd
#. default-sha256: da3d3b75d316b9c9a60bc2945c2c87fede3baa91b554d0b6059a80a603569f99
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_08082BEE_BF0F_49B8_B391_FFAFBAF0D488"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The Maid wore a gentle, but brittlely cold smile as she looked straight at ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫"
"him⟪k:3⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫女仆无比温柔，⟪k:1⟫又无比冰冷地，⟪k:2⟫浮现出让人背脊发凉的微笑。继而，凝视着「⟪k:3⟫你⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫死者⟪k:6⟫」。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2278f57b9942dc7ab58d2d03683bfa4d99acb30069e366d8c9df9d2177311c8
#. default-sha256: 515eb19737e07338760357b65c52759cb86e3addf8ed66460979eb2ba48449e3
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_59DA248B_53B8_46EA_97ED_41E3205E4794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It is not your fault misfortune befell you.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The only force to blame for that "
"is fate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫之所以会引起这些不幸，⟪k:2⟫并非您的过错。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫只不过是因为机缘不佳罢了……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 011e17774813cf1277a487bd3463ab50c971b08e12e36159f19e88b7e8cd2f4c
#. default-sha256: ec90d26139ca7b32150a5be7ded20b0e194d63ba22b8bc32b152fa5307ab8adb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D698B4F1_1523_47BA_BDE8_52FD24FF397F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You were always so kind, so pure of heart.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You had boundless trust for others and "
"the goodness of people."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫您无论在哪个年代都是那么的温柔，⟪k:1⟫那么的纯粹。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫从不怀疑别人，⟪k:4⟫始终坚信着他人"
"对您的温柔……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7954bd690fb2a9361c71df2cb83670af1cb23935e43bb8c4763ee02e1a085106
#. default-sha256: bf2c11c7df9fc8b56154ccccda102029ace3a90597c200536b66fbca57eeb459
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_43F9E646_DBDF_49D5_B6CA_BB446B46B564"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You were the very image of all that is right."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫您彷如「善」的结晶一般。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d88cd05dcdaec8778ee0a63543976f1c33d6916b35f40e4b29a6c9067d3d795
#. default-sha256: 9b5730989ac2a97e6ea2face16ffcbbd002d78232061eb68597213c42b18d9ac
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DF46AD4_9E5C_41C1_82A9_9EB6AD8E4082"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫There is no greater misfortune⟪k:2⟫than someone as pure and beautiful as you..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫或许所谓的悲剧……⟪k:2⟫正莫过于此吧。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫如您这般拥有美丽心灵的人——"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d495b7cea79e22b04499b41e48aa9574224b41492c1cbc2ac08b410f36d48f8
#. default-sha256: 652c9b1d10b52ee1915f4ac08d52f05e30072f8288911be02e270a746551d481
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FCEF73D5_C5F0_4551_8C80_48C163A936CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫being mercilessly thrown into the grinding gears of tragedy again and again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫却不可置否地，每一次都被卷入悲剧的齿轮。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7bda3705b48d405a3eb6838fea665a48e3cff8e15fa51b7962fb59ed032f325a
#. default-sha256: 8deadb6539928e427b31a866c3847b65a076b230e7c509a34c2d78b766c3d749
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8DB36CD3_1590_4FC9_9E01_681A33745D42"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I still pity you for everything you had to go through.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You poor, poor soul..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫下仆我，⟪k:2⟫如今也为您感到非常难过。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫啊，⟪k:5⟫这是何等地悲哀……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f9953598b08b2d42cc0c623945cb37a0927dc312abbd2962f04c1e2b96eafea
#. default-sha256: 48051926ad316a94a4a8bfbc3230a35c85a395d630ccc8ebf8081179f04a48ac
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_067B98EE_A44C_4082_9288_94B79A32DC58"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be utterly exhausted.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Constantly betrayed, the man you were waiting "
"for never appearing..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫您已经累了吧？⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫被坚信之人所背弃，⟪k:4⟫苦候之人又未能出现……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_405E2969_551B_4028_B181_8523B24F36F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
